FirefoxDump Armory package
==========================

This distribution is based on FirefoxDump by mrrobot1o1:
https://github.com/mrrobot1o1/firefoxdump

Upstream source revision: e5f9a4143598a0363145be5ec3f7c4496cfa9cff

The upstream repository's root LICENSE declares the project under the GNU
General Public License, version 3. This distribution is licensed under
GPL-3.0-only; the full license text is in LICENSE.

Armory packaging modifications made in August 2026 include a minimal original
BOF API header, Reflektor compatibility, read-only data access, bounds checks,
resource cleanup, and corrected Firefox cookie handling.

Earlier upstream revisions included src/common/base.c, src/common/beacon.h, and
src/common/bofdefs.h from the TrustedSec CS-Situational-Awareness-BOF project.
Those files are not included in this distribution. They were replaced with the
project-specific src/bof_api.h implementation.

The Firefox credential-decryption approach credits the firefox_decrypt project:
https://github.com/unode/firefox_decrypt
